<title>UK: CRICKET-MIDDLESEX 104 BEHIND AUSTRALIA AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MIDDLESEX 104 BEHIND AUSTRALIA AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Middlesex were 23 without loss in their second innings at lunch, 104 behind Australia first innings total of 432, on the third and final day of their match at Lord's on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Middlesex 305 (M.Gatting 85, M.Ramprakash 76; G.McGrath 4-61) and 23-0, Australia 432-7 declared (M.Waugh 142, M.Elliott 83, S.Waugh 57).</p>
</text>
